file tools/fixtures/t/tablecloth_glow_tend_scan.sh five new readings, and the derivation read rather than inferred
file tools/fixtures/t/tablecloth_glow_tend_control.sh nineteen cases in a pen -- sixteen refusals, three welcomes
file tools/t/tablecloth_glow_tend_witness.rish both desks lowered, built, and run on metal
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri the guard's comment says what it now holds; no new row
file src/shape/README.md the museum roster gains its second Tablecloth row
file session-logs/README.md two shelf counts corrected against the shelves themselves
file session-logs/CHAPTERS.md the three shelves the roster had not yet listed
file docs-geode/libraries/README.md the generated index catches up with the new module, one row
file construction/ITINERARY.md roster reading, next doors, prior lap, and this round's own nib
recommend check-in (Claude) Tablecloth's remaining bounds are mechanical now that the shape is proven both ways: max_name=48 is a plain literal like max_artifacts, and the eight ClothError paths want a count pedestal of the kind src/shape already holds for BrushSurface and ParseError. Two doors still stand above my hand, unchanged from last lap: %328's seat, where the roster's own witness reds whenever the live card holds any red, so it cannot be rostered while five stand; and the twelve elder Tend witnesses that still pin their bound a third time inside the guard, where converting them reads Dream's Caravan and Tally files against a new shape and wants his word first.
